1
00:00:00,336 --> 00:00:02,176
Hi, Peter! Come in.

2
00:00:02,448 --> 00:00:08,512
Thanks. Oh, these ping-pong bats are nice.

3
00:00:09,104 --> 00:00:10,128
Whose are they?

4
00:00:10,656 --> 00:00:13,552
Well, this is my ping-pong bat,

5
00:00:14,384 --> 00:00:16,384
and the old one is my grandpa’s.

6
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:19,552
Do you often play ping-pong together?

7
00:00:19,824 --> 00:00:22,480
Yes, we play every week.

8
00:00:22,784 --> 00:00:24,720
My grandpa loves sport.

9
00:00:25,488 --> 00:00:27,584
Whose fishing rods are those?

10
00:00:27,872 --> 00:00:29,152
They’re my father’s.

11
00:00:29,552 --> 00:00:31,536
He spends a lot of time fishing.

12
00:00:32,128 --> 00:00:34,912
Hey, do you play the piano?

13
00:00:35,136 --> 00:00:38,672
No, I don’t. It’s my mother’s piano.

14
00:00:38,992 --> 00:00:41,040
She can play it really well

